mentation through Microsoft Word.</strong></p><p><strong>As an aspiring IT professional, I am passionate about building functional and visually engaging digital solutions. I am continuously learning, improving, and growing to keep up with new technologies and industry trends.</strong></p><p><strong>I’m driven to turn ideas into reality and excited to contribute my skills and creativity to future opportunities.</strong></p>													<img width=\"492\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09-492x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09-492x1024.jpg 492w, http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09-144x300.jpg 144w, http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09.jpg 715w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 492px) 100vw, 492px\" />																<h2>ABOUT ME</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									SEE RESUME\n					</a>\n									<h1>MY WORKS</h1>					<h1>MY SKILLS</h1>					<h1>TOOLS I USED</h1>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M277 170.7A85.35 85.35 0 0 0 277 0H106.3a85.3 85.3 0 0 0 0 170.6 85.35 85.35 0 0 0 0 170.7 85.35 85.35 0 1 0 85.3 85.4v-256zm0 0a85.3 85.3 0 1 0 85.3 85.3 85.31 85.31 0 0 0-85.3-85.3z\"></path></svg>			\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M61.7 169.4l101.5 278C92.2 413 43.3 340.2 43.3 256c0-30.9 6.6-60.1 18.4-86.6zm337.9 75.9c0-26.3-9.4-44.5-17.5-58.7-10.8-17.5-20.9-32.4-20.9-49.9 0-19.6 14.8-37.8 35.7-37.8.9 0 1.8.1 2.8.2-37.9-34.7-88.3-55.9-143.7-55.9-74.3 0-139.7 38.1-177.8 95.9 5 .2 9.7.3 13.7.3 22.2 0 56.7-2.7 56.7-2.7 11.5-.7 12.8 16.2 1.4 17.5 0 0-11.5 1.3-24.3 2l77.5 230.4L249.8 247l-33.1-90.8c-11.5-.7-22.3-2-22.3-2-11.5-.7-10.1-18.2 1.3-17.5 0 0 35.1 2.7 56 2.7 22.2 0 56.7-