g documentation through Microsoft Word.</strong></p><p><strong>As an aspiring IT professional, I am passionate about building functional and visually engaging digital solutions. I am continuously learning, improving, and growing to keep up with new technologies and industry trends.</strong></p><p><strong>I’m driven to turn ideas into reality and excited to contribute my skills and creativity to future opportunities.</strong></p>													<img width=\"492\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09-492x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09-492x1024.jpg 492w, http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09-144x300.jpg 144w, http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09.jpg 715w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 492px) 100vw, 492px\" />																<h2>ABOUT ME</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									SEE RESUME\n					</a>\n									<h1>MY WORKS</h1>					<h1>MY SKILLS</h1>					<h1>Skills That Drive Results</h1>					<h1>A blend of technical expertise, creative thinking, and soft skills<br> to deliver exceptional results.</h1>					<h2>Technical Skills</h2>								\n				HTML/CSS			\n									77%\n				JavaScript			\n									69%\n				PHP			\n									82%\n				MySQL			\n									84%\n				WordPress			\n									34%\n				Elementor			\n									58%\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M512.1 191l-8.2 14.3c-3 5.3-9.4 7.5-15.1 5.4-11.8-4.4-22.6-10.7-32.1-18.6-4.6-3.8-5.8-10.5-2.8-15.7l8.2-14.3c-6.9-8-12.3-17.3-15.9-27.4h-16.5c-6 0-11.2-4.3-12.2-10.3-2-12-2.1-24.6 0-37.1 1-6 6.2-10.4 12.2-10.4h16.5c3.6-10.1 9-19.4 15.9-27.4l-8.2-14.3c-3-5.2-1.9-11.9 2.8-15.7 9.5-7.9 20.4-14.2 32.1-18.6 5.7-2.1 12.1.1 15.1 5.4l8.2 14.3c10.5-1.9 21.2-1.9 31.7 0L552 6.3c3-5.3 9.4-7.5 15.1-5.4 11.8 4.4 22.6 1